// DECLARATIVE-NOW / OPERATIONS-DEFERRED-WITH-OWNER (#3169/#3184).
// Modeled: YamlValue. Deferred parse/emit (incl. anchor/alias + tag) —
// 🟡 gated — feature: T-6/T-7 parse pipeline-stage substrate — DECISIONS.md Part 6 · SL-3229-T4-FORMAT-T6T7.
